Z||000017||mrfiero||02-14-2001||11:09 PM||||That's the problem with the '88 upper ball joints......NO ONE makes them!  Your only choice is GM......the ball joints the Fiero Store sells are original GM.  Since the production numbers for the '88 Fiero are so low and that no other car uses the same balljoints, no manufacturer wants to pony up the $$$ to make them.  If they did they would be expensive.  <P>Buy some now while you still can!  The good news is the upper ball joints last longer  than the lowers, so buying one or two sets today should last a long time.   ||||reg||1
